Notable modifications by Palimpsest (see git history for details):
- TTS-first narration layer (Kokoro/Qwen3 via a local MLX sidecar) with
  word-level synchrony against the rendered PDF.
- The Prof: an in-book tutor (voice in/out, page-grounded ink annotations,
  Socratic disclosure ladder, chapter sessions) with a persistent learner model.
- The .hpub dual-layer import pipeline with math-preserving extraction,
  glyph-garbage detection, targeted LLM cleanup, and stall-watchdog hardening.
- The Apothecary design system (UI reskin).
